{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57581","headline":"汉祖天师口诀 · 无名氏","name":"汉祖天师口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铅抽髓，髓抽精，精髓相合丹必成。\n一斤水银十七两，一两变化是铅精。\n将此铅精作大丹，老子九转入生研。\n一丽水银特牛力，服之令人貌若仙，貌若仙兮筋骨坚。\n筋骨坚强返枯槁，截舌人间不须道。\n未能隐显出没藏，切慎惧口莫颠狂。\n若教上界天神怒，恐遭非横及刀光。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}